{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:53 2026-06-10 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:42 2026-06-10 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:42 2026-06-10 HKT</p><p>今(10日)早上8時27分，嶼南道羅屋村一名8歲女童在家中暈倒，其母親發現報警求助。救援人員接報趕至現場，女童陷入昏迷，政府飛行服務隊派出直升機，將女童送往東區醫院，惜經搶救後不治。警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"警員到醫院調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4b0686056d50b0407ae551e783f31c86/2026-06/IMG_3374_JPG.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cea99af7de350e94a6205b369879e9c7/2026-06/IMG_3358_JPG.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"女童送院後不治。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3b36727721b733c72011670f2e1e2fe4/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-10_at_10_48_19_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bbf5a8a60f8753b4804dd03c3789c064/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-10_at_10_48_19.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/36b1c40a2a7040ac844b1e9945e5537b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-10_at_10_48_19_2_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-10T07:20:28.976548+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}